     ],
     "description": "The clear-sky upwelling interface flux of the solver column, the sum over the band g-points of the per-g-point uclfl scaling wtdiff*delwave(ib)*fluxfac (rrtmg_lw_rtrnmc.f90:449-466); the spectral sum is kept a plain sum, the exact transcription of the Fortran totals loop, because the g-points of a band are a discrete spectral set with no ordered integration axis."
