   "tests": [
    {
     "id": "sweep_step3",
     "description": "The rtrnmc sweep at step 3 (the 1997-06-19 00 UTC radiation call, tod 3585 s; defaults are the step-3 dump arrays, no overrides). All 140 g-points of the column are cloud-free (cldfmc = taucmc = 0), so icldlyr = iclddn = 0, the clear streams equal the total streams, and uclfl = uflux, dclfl = dflux exactly; the uflux/uclfl assertions at k_ifc = 1 (the TOA upwelling) and the dflux/dclfl assertions at k_ifc = 2, 17, 34 exercise the quadratic and Pade-table gas branches of the layer laws (odepth = secdiff*taut spans 1e-7..5e5 across the column), the linear-in-tau Planck sources, the down and up sweeps, the specular surface and the per-g-point flux scaling wtdiff*delwave(ib)*fluxfac (rrtmg_lw_rtrnmc.f90:441-466). Expected values are the dump columns uflux/dflux/uclfl/dclfl of cam_rad_rtrnmc_ifc.csv (selected, not derived, by extract_cam_rrtmg_lw_pins.py) at rel 1e-11 (uflux/uclfl) and 1e-12 (dflux/dclfl), the measured max rel errors of the suite being 2.1e-12 and 9.1e-13 (CLI, every pin at rel 1e-15): the .esm evaluates the sweep recurrence as an expression tree while gfortran evaluates the single statement of rrtmg_lw_rtrnmc.f90:290-365 with its own association, so the last ulps differ, amplified where a g-point's increment is a small fraction of the accumulated band radiance; the band-summed totals totuflux/totdflux/totuclfl/totdclfl are pinned at rel 1e-12 (measured max 1.4e-15, the ulp differences telescoping away at band level).",
     "time_span": {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.0
     },
     "initial_conditions": {},
     "parameter_overrides": {},
     "assertions": [
      {
       "variable": "uflux",
       "time": 0.0,
       "coords": {
        "gpt": 1,
        "k_ifc": 1
       },
       "expected": 8.549181733527236,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-11
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "uclfl",
       "time": 0.0,
       "coords": {
        "gpt": 1,
        "k_ifc": 1
       },
       "expected": 8.549181733527236,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-11
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "uflux",
       "time": 0.0,
       "coords": {
        "gpt": 1,
        "k_ifc": 2
       },
       "expected": 8.549181678431678,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-11
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "dflux",
       "time": 0.0,
       "coords": {
        "gpt": 1,
        "k_ifc": 2
       },
       "expected": 1.956725849183041e-06,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "uclfl",
       "time": 0.0,
       "coords": {
        "gpt": 1,
        "k_ifc": 2
       },
       "expected": 8.549181678431678,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-11
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "dclfl",
       "time": 0.0,
       "coords": {
        "gpt": 1,
        "k_ifc": 2
       },
       "expected": 1.956725849183041e-06,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "uflux",
       "time": 0.0,
       "coords": {
        "gpt": 1,
        "k_ifc": 17
       },
       "expected": 8.608402548325087,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-11
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "dflux",
       "time": 0.0,
       "coords": {
        "gpt": 1,
        "k_ifc": 17
       },
       "expected": 0.15918026556331522,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
