     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K/s",
     "shape": [
      "k_ifc"
     ],
     "description": "The total-sky layer heating rate htr(l) = heatfac*(fnet(l) - fnet(l+1))/(pz(l) - pz(l+1)) of rrtmg_lw_rtrnmc.f90:493 with heatfac = gravit*cday*1e-5/(cpair*1e-3) = 8.433391304347827 (rrtmg_lw_init.f90:212), the layer between the interfaces k_ifc and k_ifc+1: computed for k_ifc = 1..33 (k_ifc = 1 the extra top layer, k_ifc = 33 the surface layer) and zero at k_ifc = 34, the non-existent layer below the surface (the Fortran zeroes its corresponding last entry htr(nlayers) = 0 at rrtmg_lw_rtrnmc.f90:498)."
    },
    "htrc_td": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K/s",
